[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237573\">1076B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the flexible mounting for the\npower unit rear support (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013429.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the flexible mounting for the power\nunit rear support and fix it to the crossmember tightening the bolts to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INTERM RUBBER MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.1 - 3.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237573\">1076B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the flexible mounting for the\npower unit intermediate support (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013933.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the flexible mounting for the power\nunit rear support and fix it to the suspension crossmember tightening\nthe bolts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INTERM RUBBER MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.7 - 3.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p>"],[6,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nstop OFF, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237699\">1072C44</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237706\">1080B40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and remove the heat shield (1b).</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the flexible mounting for the\npower unit rear (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013934.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the flexible mounting for the power\nunit rear support and fix it  tightening the bolts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INTERM RUBBER MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Front suspension crossmember side) 2.7 ÷ 3.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Place the heat shield back in its housing\nand fix it using the nuts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237706\">1080B40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237699\">1072C44</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237704\">1076B18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237563\">1076A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Position a hydraulic jack under the engine.</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and nut (1b) and remove the reinforcing link\n(1c).</p><p>2. Undo the bolt fixing the rear power unit rigid support to the\nflexible mounting.</p><p>3. Loosen the bolts fixing the rigid rear support to the gearbox\nand to the engine oil sump, then rotate it, as necessary, to move\nit away</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014354.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the flexible mounting for the\npower unit rear support (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014355.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the flexible mounting for the power unit rear support (1a)\nand fix it to the crossmember by tightening the bolts (1b) to the\nrecommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INTERM RUBBER MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Front suspension crossmember side) 3.2 ÷ 3.9</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014356.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>1. Refit the power unit rear rigid support (1a) in its seating and\nsecure by tightening  the bolts (1b), (1c) and (1d) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>POWER UNIT RIGID REAR MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Gearbox side) 6.8 ÷ 8.3</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>POWER UNIT RIGID REAR MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine oil sump side) 6.8 ÷ 8.3</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Refit the reinforcement strut (2a) and tighten the bolt (2b)\nand nut (2c) to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>POWER UNIT REAR RIGID SUPPORT REINFORCEMENT ROD....</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>6.8 ÷ 8.3</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>POWER UNIT REAR RIGID SUPPORT REINFORCEMENT ROD....</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>5.0 ÷ 6.1</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014357.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Remove the hydraulic jack from beneath\nthe engine</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237563\">1076A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237704\">1076B18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the flexible mounting for the\npower unit rear support (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014897.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the flexible mounting for the power\nunit rear support and fix it tightening the bolts to the recommended troque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INTERM RUBBER MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.7 - 3.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a clas